WEBVTT

00:00.080 --> 00:01.680
If I concede today

00:02.160 --> 00:03.120
In the future

00:03.200 --> 00:04.920
How can I govern the state?

00:05.000 --> 00:06.320
Order the city defense forces

00:06.480 --> 00:07.880
To hold firm

00:07.960 --> 00:09.960
Must hold until General Zu Yue arrives

00:10.040 --> 00:11.240
Yes

00:12.500 --> 00:17.500
Under your leadership, the defending garrison fought with all their might against the allied grand army of the regional aristocratic clans, yet they could only hold out for a mere three days, ultimately failing to await reinforcements from Zu Yue.

00:18.500 --> 00:27.500
The rebel army stormed into the imperial city, and after executing you, subsequently enthroned the Second Prince Sikong Xu.

00:28.500 --> 00:35.500
Perpetually coerced by the Chen clan, all state policies favored the aristocratic families, drastically turning back the wheel of history, and the new laws you had instituted were ordered to a halt.

00:37.000 --> 00:45.500
Looking back through historical records, Great Xuan was thenceforth trapped in hardship in the south, and you were remembered by posterity as...
